263
00:16:59.788 --> 00:17:01.056
That's cute.

264
00:17:04.660 --> 00:17:06.660
I was thinking.

265
00:17:06.662 --> 00:17:08.662
It's ironic.

266
00:17:08.664 --> 00:17:10.997
Here I thought I was stuck
in the same day

267
00:17:10.999 --> 00:17:13.934
