268
00:17:13.936 --> 00:17:16.370
You know,
facing my mom's death.

269
00:17:17.840 --> 00:17:20.941
It had nothing to do with her.

270
00:17:20.943 --> 00:17:24.680
Turns out it was just
some big scientific fluke.

271
00:17:27.149 --> 00:17:29.985
