- Down here!

293
00:20:43.111 --> 00:20:45.011
Holy shit.

294
00:20:45.013 --> 00:20:46.646
Are you okay?

295
00:20:46.648 --> 00:20:48.617
Yeah, I think so.

296
00:20:51.720 --> 00:20:53.353
Well, damn. Good job.

297
00:20:53.355 --> 00:20:55.822
- I have a little practice.
- What the hell?

298
00:20:55.824 --> 00:20:57.023
