00:32:15.938 --> 00:32:17.503
Sorry. I'm on my way.

514
00:32:17.505 --> 00:32:19.474
I'll be there in a little bit.

515
00:32:20.876 --> 00:32:22.642
I have to go. Um...

516
00:32:22.644 --> 00:32:24.343
Wait, what?
